## Disambiguation Guide (Critical Context)
*Use this logic to distinguish between similar products:*
- **Freshdesk** is for **External Customer Support** (B2C/B2B). Use when users ask about "helping customers," "support tickets," or "contact centers."
- **Freshservice** is for **Internal IT & Employee Service** (ITSM/ESM). Use when users ask about "IT helpdesk," "employee onboarding," "asset management," or "internal tickets."

